{
  "id": 8867179331783,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 06",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-06",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a celebration of America's favorite pastime with the Jeminise Personalized Baseball Comforter Bed Set. Crafted for baseball enthusiasts, this set combines comfort with custom style, making it a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize with names or text to create a unique bedding set, perfect for baseball players and fans.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\") to fit your bed perfectly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection dyeing techniques to prevent fading and ensures smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting durability.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric, offering a soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Microfiber Filling:</strong> Whole-piece microfiber filling with tight stitching prevents clumping or shifting, ensuring consistent comfort.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and becomes fluffier after washing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for men, women, moms, dads, and perfect for Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, or Christmas.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Baseball Vintage 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Multiple Size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pillowcase Quantity</th>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age Range Description</th>\n<td>Toddler</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
